<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in the <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/">College of Health Solutions</a> at Arizona State University. I see that you started an application with us but have not yet completed it.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Your next steps to complete the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp">application</a> are:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><font face="arial">Request your official GRE scores using ASU's institutional code: 4007</font></li><li><font face="arial">Remind your recommenders to submit their letters of recommendation.</font></li><li><font face="arial">If applicable, request your proof of <a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/proficiency">English proficiency</a> using ASU's institutional code: 4007.</font></li><li><font face="arial">Send your official hard copy transcripts to:</font></li></ul><div><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span><b>Regular Mail:</b></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="font-weight: bold; white-space: pre;">	</span>Arizona State University</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span>Graduate Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span>PO Box 871003</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span>Tempe AZ 85287-1003</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span><b>FedEx, DHL, UPS:</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space: pre;">	</span>Arizona State University</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span>Graduate Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span>1151 S. Forest Avenue, #SSV112</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span>Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Please reply to this email to let us know when we can expect to receive these remaining materials.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you, and I look forward to hearing from you.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><div>{!User.Email}</div><div><font color="#ffffff"><br></font></div><div><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">	</span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
